# PLACEHOLDER -- Hemp Parquet: hemp_planks.png laid as a basket weave.
#
# The four 8x8 squares are cut straight out of hemp_planks.png: the top-left and
# bottom-right squares as they are, the other two turned on their side (the texture's own
# transpose). So every board is a real hemp plank with its grain and its seam, and the
# weave is vanilla bamboo mosaic's -- square cells, boards alternating direction -- which
# is the one decorative plank pattern the game already has. It tiles by construction:
# each square keeps the planks' seam on one side only, so no seam doubles across a join.
#
# If hemp_planks.png is ever redrawn, rebuild this from it the same way rather than
# retouching it: the point is that the floor is the same wood as the planks.

@palette hemp_planks
. = none
1 = 5A5236
2 = 67603E
3 = 82794E
4 = 8A8155
5 = 948A5E
6 = A1976C
7 = A89D73

